Mission Brief

The Integrated Engine Design team shapes the architecture of the Sea Level and Vacuum engines. Integrates every subsystem into one compact, reliable package, and designs, analyzes, and tests the piping and structural components that keep the engine together and performing as it should. &nbsp;

As a Working Student, you will be contributing to the development and modeling of the piping system of our latest engines, including secondary lines and sensor capillaries . You will work and have impact on flight hardware, and will get to see your designs move from CAD to manufacturing and testing.

